+# NeoForge 26.1.2.95 Fabric 6.33.1 parity runtime-safe follow-up
+
+Based on the server-smoke-validated 3.1.0 parity port. This follow-up removes the last stale Fabric-only reflective owner-credit class reference from bow/trident/potion combat and adds official-name fallbacks to ghost-aggro cleanup fields. No movement, target-lock, swimming, rendering, persistence, dimension, or combat tuning is otherwise changed.
